+## Sales (schema 3)
+
+Schema 2 migrates to schema 3 by adding an empty `sales` collection without
+changing existing records. Each sale row has an id from `seq.sale`, ticket,
+UTC `soldAt`, dishId, qty (whole portions), and scaled `ingredients` snapshots
+(itemId and qty). Snapshots keep historical theoretical use stable if recipes
+change. Persisted tickets are skipped on subsequent imports. A whole file is
+committed only after every row validates and all stock consumption succeeds.
